WEBVTT

00:04.295 --> 00:05.422
I will find them...

00:07.048 --> 00:09.968
The ones who set me...
and my Holy Knights up...

00:11.886 --> 00:12.762
And...

00:13.471 --> 00:16.349
I will find those who set Senerva up.

00:17.225 --> 00:18.601
I swear...

00:19.477 --> 00:21.146
I'll kill them.

00:22.856 --> 00:24.649
Xylo, Xylo!

00:24.733 --> 00:27.152
Were you dreaming about something?

00:29.946 --> 00:35.160
A frail-looking man named Venetim
told me to wake you up.

00:35.243 --> 00:37.746
Thank me properly and sing my praises.

00:37.829 --> 00:39.581
Tell him I'm on my way.

00:39.664 --> 00:41.458
I cannot do that.

00:41.541 --> 00:43.793
If I leave,
you will go back to sleep, right?

00:43.877 --> 00:44.878
Yes.

00:45.545 --> 00:46.463
Seriously...

00:46.546 --> 00:49.382
It is not like admitting it
will get you back to sleep.

00:49.466 --> 00:50.717
Why?

00:50.800 --> 00:52.302
What do you mean, "why"?

00:53.011 --> 00:54.679
Why are you still here?

00:54.763 --> 00:56.890
You should understand who we are by now.

00:59.559 --> 01:00.393
That's right.

01:01.478 --> 01:03.521
It is said that those sentenced
to be heroes

01:03.605 --> 01:05.523
are all people
who have committed heinous crimes.

01:06.566 --> 01:09.110
And I heard about your past...

01:09.194 --> 01:11.071
- Then...
- My knight!

01:11.654 --> 01:13.907
There must be a reason, right?

01:17.744 --> 01:21.372
No matter the reason,
it's true that I killed a goddess.

01:21.456 --> 01:23.208
That won't change.

01:23.291 --> 01:25.460
Besides a goddess perishing,

01:25.543 --> 01:28.755
a covenant can be terminated
by mutual consent.

01:28.838 --> 01:30.298
- So hurry up and--
- I refuse.

01:30.381 --> 01:31.424
What?

01:31.508 --> 01:35.136
I told you, you are my knight.

01:39.390 --> 01:41.351
Xylo, are you awake?

01:41.434 --> 01:43.144
We're in trouble!

01:43.228 --> 01:45.146
Venetim, don't yell all of a sudden!

01:45.230 --> 01:46.231
Try me, and I'll kill you.

01:47.982 --> 01:53.113
Unfortunately, I might die
before you can kill me.

01:53.196 --> 01:54.030
What?

01:54.114 --> 01:56.241
It looks like we have our next mission.

01:57.117 --> 01:58.243
Are you serious?

01:58.326 --> 02:01.496
After all,
we're just cannon fodder heroes.

02:01.579 --> 02:04.207
But if possible, I don't want to die.

02:04.290 --> 02:06.918
Let's discuss the details.

02:07.001 --> 02:08.211
You bastard...

02:08.294 --> 02:09.420
My knight.

02:09.504 --> 02:10.880
Let's go.

02:10.964 --> 02:13.216
You need my power, don't you?

02:15.301 --> 02:16.344
Keep it down!

02:16.886 --> 02:18.012
- What happened?
- You audacious insect!

02:18.096 --> 02:20.265
- That's Tatsuya and His Majesty.
- How dare you disturb my rest?

02:20.348 --> 02:22.642
Tatsuya? His Majesty?

02:22.725 --> 02:23.726
Yeah.

02:23.810 --> 02:26.604
They're all heroes, just like me.

02:34.279 --> 02:35.947
Whoa!

02:36.030 --> 02:38.533
Xylo! The river's frozen!

02:38.616 --> 02:41.494
I didn't think a river
this big could freeze.

02:41.578 --> 02:43.955
Come on, Xylo! You should see this!

02:44.038 --> 02:45.915
Come on. Look, look!

02:45.999 --> 02:47.959
- Sigh...
- Look over there!

02:49.043 --> 02:50.420
Please take a look.

02:51.838 --> 02:55.091
The thirteenth goddess's transport
has been aborted.

02:55.174 --> 02:58.261
Reassignment issued.
Begin operations in the Zewan Gan Tunnels.

02:59.345 --> 03:02.390
Has the Demon Blight
corrupted that place too?

03:02.473 --> 03:05.351
The Fourth War of Subjugation...

03:05.435 --> 03:09.439
Ever since the emergence
of Demon Blight Number One, the Serpent,

03:09.522 --> 03:13.026
forests have been ravaged,
and the land has been corrupted.

03:13.693 --> 03:18.990
In the past 20 years,
half of humanity's habitat has been lost.

03:19.073 --> 03:22.952
We must stop the damage from spreading.

03:23.036 --> 03:26.664
The hero unit is already heading
to the Zewan Gan Tunnels.

03:27.415 --> 03:29.876
You should be able to meet up
with them quickly if you go by horse.

03:30.960 --> 03:32.462
I'll head out right away.

03:32.545 --> 03:34.464
I'm counting on you.

03:39.052 --> 03:41.137
Oh, right.

03:41.221 --> 03:45.225
If you happen to meet High Priest Marlen,

03:45.308 --> 03:47.268
please give him my regards.

03:52.690 --> 03:57.111
By the way, that thief Dotta isn't around.

03:57.195 --> 03:59.447
Dotta is at the repair shop.

04:00.406 --> 04:03.743
I'm sure it was Xylo who beat him up.

04:03.826 --> 04:04.994
Good grief.

04:05.078 --> 04:08.539
As my subordinate, you should be
more mindful of your conduct.

04:08.623 --> 04:11.417
Yes, yes.
Your Majesty is absolutely right.

04:12.001 --> 04:15.463
Hey... what do you mean by "Your Majesty"?

04:15.546 --> 04:17.131
It's exactly what it sounds like.

04:17.215 --> 04:22.595
Norgalle truly believes he's the king
of the Federated Kingdom.

04:22.679 --> 04:23.888
What?

04:24.681 --> 04:26.307
He carried out
a large-scale terrorist attack

04:26.391 --> 04:28.559
against the leadership
of the "usurped" kingdom

04:28.643 --> 04:30.353
and was ultimately sentenced to be a hero.

04:31.104 --> 04:32.522
He's a former terrorist.

04:33.898 --> 04:35.024
Yes...

04:35.108 --> 04:37.986
Th-Then, what about that guy over there?

04:38.069 --> 04:39.612
That's Tatsuya.

04:39.696 --> 04:41.155
I don't know what his crime is,

04:41.239 --> 04:44.450
but he's been
in the hero unit the longest.

04:45.034 --> 04:48.246
He looks a bit clueless.

04:48.329 --> 04:50.123
That's because heroes
lose parts of themselves

04:50.206 --> 04:52.417
and memories every time
they're resurrected.

04:53.418 --> 04:55.169
If I'm not careful,
I might end up like that too.

04:56.963 --> 04:58.381
Jeez.

04:58.464 --> 05:02.593
How much worse can this punishment be?

05:11.644 --> 05:12.520
Well...

05:13.104 --> 05:16.274
Looks like we're quite welcome here.

05:17.817 --> 05:18.776
Let's go.

05:24.157 --> 05:27.118
This town is so depressing.

05:27.201 --> 05:31.539
Well, at this rate, it's going to be
devoured by the Demon Blight.

05:35.585 --> 05:37.503
This place won't last long.

05:37.587 --> 05:40.840
Is there really nothing you can do?

05:40.923 --> 05:43.885
Unfortunately, this is
the military's decision.

05:43.968 --> 05:48.264
Normally, we would evacuate everyone.

05:48.347 --> 05:49.932
Are they waiting for someone?

05:59.108 --> 06:00.443
I'd like to ask you something.

06:01.903 --> 06:03.279
Are you...

06:04.072 --> 06:05.740
a hero?

06:05.823 --> 06:08.409
Don't be so nervous.

06:08.493 --> 06:10.620
We're here to suppress the tunnels.

06:10.703 --> 06:12.705
If you have digging tools,
could you lend us...

06:12.789 --> 06:13.956
At this point,

06:14.040 --> 06:15.291
what can you do?

06:16.751 --> 06:19.378
It's all... too late.

06:19.462 --> 06:21.672
Why didn't you do something sooner...

06:27.386 --> 06:28.596
Um...

06:32.350 --> 06:35.311
What is it? What are you looking at?

06:36.354 --> 06:38.523
The tunnels are that way.

06:40.858 --> 06:41.818
Thank you.

06:47.073 --> 06:49.951
Dad didn't come back.

06:51.035 --> 06:52.912
He said...

06:52.995 --> 06:55.706
he would come back on my birthday.

07:05.883 --> 07:06.801
Damn it.

07:07.593 --> 07:09.762
Don't look at me like that.

07:11.681 --> 07:14.892
Because the Zewan Gan Tunnels
produce high-grade iron ore

07:14.976 --> 07:16.853
that can be used
as a catalyst for sacred seals,

07:16.936 --> 07:19.021
the Verkle Development Corporation
and the military

07:19.105 --> 07:21.566
appear to have invested heavily in them.

07:21.649 --> 07:24.902
But now, the entire tunnels
have turned into a faerie.

07:24.986 --> 07:27.488
It's ironic, really.

07:27.572 --> 07:28.656
I see.

07:28.739 --> 07:31.784
My knight, what is a "sacred seal"?

07:32.368 --> 07:34.495
According to the people at the Temple,

07:34.579 --> 07:37.582
it's the wisdom bestowed
upon mankind by God.

07:37.665 --> 07:38.499
However,

07:39.208 --> 07:42.795
I can only use two of them
with my current body.

07:43.337 --> 07:46.215
This is His Majesty Norgalle's
specialty, isn't it?

07:46.966 --> 07:50.219
After all, His Majesty is a genius
who can perform alone a tuning

07:50.303 --> 07:52.513
that normally requires several people.

07:52.597 --> 07:53.806
Goddess.

07:53.890 --> 07:58.728
By using sunlight as the energy
for sacred seals inscribed upon objects

07:58.811 --> 08:03.107
and activating them with human will
and life force as the spark,

08:03.691 --> 08:05.735
it can produce all sorts of effects,

08:05.818 --> 08:09.780
such as striking lightning,
shattering the earth, and releasing heat.

08:12.033 --> 08:13.743
Whoa!

08:13.826 --> 08:16.370
That's amazing, Xylo!

08:16.454 --> 08:17.663
However,

08:17.747 --> 08:19.707
relying on sacred seals alone
can't defeat the enemy.

08:19.790 --> 08:21.876
It's said that a month ago,

08:21.959 --> 08:26.172
the miners who turned into faeries
began attacking people indiscriminately.

08:26.255 --> 08:28.382
The Demon Blight, huh?

08:28.466 --> 08:29.884
Yes.

08:29.967 --> 08:31.969
The details are still unclear,

08:32.053 --> 08:35.765
but it's been named
Number Fifty-One, Lotus.

08:35.848 --> 08:37.016
And our mission is

08:37.099 --> 08:41.103
to dig a passage for the Holy Knights
to launch their assault.

08:41.187 --> 08:44.190
However, regrettably,

08:44.273 --> 08:47.777
I must remain in town as the commander.

08:48.361 --> 08:50.905
- What? Are you kidding me?
- Alright.

08:51.572 --> 08:52.406
Everyone.

08:52.990 --> 08:54.242
Please hurry

08:54.325 --> 08:56.702
and get in!

09:07.964 --> 09:09.799
We might be digging

09:09.882 --> 09:11.801
our own graves here.

09:11.884 --> 09:16.013
I already carved sacred seals onto them,
and this is all you have to show?

09:16.556 --> 09:18.683
Hurry up and dig forward!

09:18.766 --> 09:20.768
We're already going as fast as we can.

09:20.851 --> 09:21.936
Right?

09:24.605 --> 09:27.108
You seem to be having a hard time, Xylo.

09:27.942 --> 09:31.612
So, why don't I take over?

09:31.696 --> 09:33.281
No.

09:33.864 --> 09:36.993
We can't carelessly waste
a goddess's energy.

09:37.076 --> 09:40.288
But I have nothing to do.

09:40.371 --> 09:41.205
What?

09:41.289 --> 09:44.709
If I just sit around,
no one will praise me!

09:44.792 --> 09:46.627
Just stay put.

09:47.962 --> 09:51.340
Looks like you're taking
your mission seriously.

09:52.633 --> 09:54.260
Xylo Forbartz.

09:55.803 --> 09:58.222
Of course I've got to be serious,
or I'll die.

09:58.306 --> 10:00.057
Goddess.

10:00.141 --> 10:02.977
Would you like to rest in our tent?

10:03.060 --> 10:06.188
No, I must witness the results
of my knight's work.

10:06.272 --> 10:07.857
Because I am a goddess.

10:08.608 --> 10:09.817
But...

10:09.900 --> 10:13.821
The Goddess wishes to come
with us to the front lines.

10:13.904 --> 10:17.658
Therefore, as king, I reject your request.

10:18.451 --> 10:20.911
Xylo, is this man like this...

10:20.995 --> 10:22.788
because of the side effects
of his resurrection?

10:22.872 --> 10:23.789
He's always been like this.

10:24.749 --> 10:25.916
I see...

10:27.710 --> 10:31.339
Dotta Luzulas explained
how he stole the Goddess.

10:31.422 --> 10:33.507
Why didn't you explain then?

10:34.508 --> 10:36.385
Would you have believed me if I had?

10:37.470 --> 10:40.056
Besides, there was no time.

10:41.015 --> 10:42.850
Next time, make sure
you explain it properly.

10:42.933 --> 10:45.436
It's the duty of those
on the same mission.

10:46.062 --> 10:46.896
You're one to talk.

10:47.772 --> 10:50.316
You're the one who ordered us
to do this mission.

10:50.941 --> 10:51.901
What?

10:52.735 --> 10:57.114
A faerie-corrupted mine like this
is generally best left alone.

10:57.198 --> 10:59.784
Everyone's busy preparing for winter.
This isn't the time.

10:59.867 --> 11:01.494
What are you trying to say?

11:01.577 --> 11:03.996
I don't know if this is the military's
decision or the Temple's,

11:04.080 --> 11:06.540
but it's a pointless mission, isn't it?

11:07.166 --> 11:08.876
What's the real objective?

11:08.959 --> 11:11.545
If it's not just to mess with us...

11:17.843 --> 11:20.429
Are you planning to do
something with Teoritta?

11:20.513 --> 11:21.722
Well?

11:26.769 --> 11:28.521
Stop making pointless speculations.

11:29.230 --> 11:31.524
Just focus on the mission.

11:37.029 --> 11:38.072
Jeez.

11:38.989 --> 11:41.909
This whole thing is getting weird.

11:53.295 --> 11:54.505
They're coming!

12:10.604 --> 12:12.106
Not a chance!

12:15.317 --> 12:17.778
It's hard
to control the explosions. Tatsuya!

12:22.825 --> 12:25.369
- Amazing...
- Mhm.

12:43.137 --> 12:45.890
That's my elite soldier for you.

12:45.973 --> 12:48.017
Although he doesn't need support...

12:48.809 --> 12:51.729
it's about time to let him rest.

12:57.401 --> 12:58.861
Oh...

12:58.944 --> 13:01.405
It's partially corrupted,

13:01.489 --> 13:04.158
but the surface seems fine.

13:06.577 --> 13:09.830
Let's make this
the Holy Knights' frontline base.

13:09.914 --> 13:11.957
Start setting up camp!

13:19.340 --> 13:20.299
Xylo!

13:20.382 --> 13:22.468
It's my turn, right?

13:22.551 --> 13:24.220
Leave it to me.

13:24.303 --> 13:25.721
Calm down.

13:26.347 --> 13:28.682
Where should I stick this rod?

13:28.766 --> 13:29.642
Ah!

13:29.725 --> 13:33.395
My knight, the corrupted area
has expanded again!

13:34.271 --> 13:35.314
Stay there.

13:43.322 --> 13:49.286
Drive the steel spikes in at intervals
of three large steps, all evenly spaced.

13:49.370 --> 13:52.206
Then secure ropes to them and apply
a sacred seal to create a barrier.

13:54.500 --> 13:55.918
All right, look!

13:57.211 --> 14:00.881
Just like this,
I can take it from here, right?

14:00.965 --> 14:03.467
Make sure you reward me properly
once it is done.

14:07.638 --> 14:09.598
Anyway, I'm counting on you.

14:10.224 --> 14:11.892
Be careful not to get hurt.

14:12.685 --> 14:14.562
What else are you going to do, Xylo?

14:15.354 --> 14:17.481
I'm going to get supplies.

14:17.565 --> 14:21.277
We have to distribute them
to the Holy Knights coming in later...

14:21.902 --> 14:22.820
What was that sound?

14:27.324 --> 14:29.451
I did pretty well, didn't I?

14:29.535 --> 14:31.287
Whoa!

14:31.370 --> 14:33.622
That's amazing!

14:33.706 --> 14:35.082
That's really impressive.

14:39.003 --> 14:43.132
This is a lethal execution device designed
to repel anyone who approaches carelessly.

14:43.215 --> 14:44.466
It's called...

14:44.550 --> 14:46.427
Zolinvolkov.

14:47.052 --> 14:49.638
It means "the judgment of the fool."

14:53.142 --> 14:56.020
So how do we disarm the trap?

14:56.103 --> 14:57.563
If you look carefully,

14:58.147 --> 15:01.525
you'll notice that some parts
of the ground trigger attacks,

15:01.609 --> 15:02.526
while others don't.

15:03.110 --> 15:05.821
However, that's exactly the trap.

15:05.905 --> 15:08.073
If a fool comes into contact
with the vessel,

15:08.157 --> 15:10.826
he'll be incinerated
by the flame of judgment.

15:10.910 --> 15:13.245
The only way to disarm the trap
is to use this key...

15:13.329 --> 15:14.371
Tatsuya!

15:14.455 --> 15:15.372
Wh-What are you doing?

15:15.956 --> 15:17.291
You insolent man!

15:17.791 --> 15:21.003
Are you trying to wipe out
the attack team?

15:21.086 --> 15:24.298
Leave only the bare minimum of devices
and remove the rest.

15:25.799 --> 15:27.927
You... you guys...

15:28.010 --> 15:32.389
- Heroes sure are weirdos.
- Are you planning to rebel against me?

15:36.143 --> 15:38.938
Damn it, the fire's too low.

15:39.021 --> 15:40.522
Leave it to me.

15:45.778 --> 15:48.197
Should I make it stronger?

15:48.280 --> 15:50.616
No, a low heat will do.

16:00.084 --> 16:01.210
Done!

16:01.293 --> 16:04.129
It is even better than before.

16:04.213 --> 16:06.674
Would you like another, my knight?

16:06.757 --> 16:08.550
Oh, yes...

16:08.634 --> 16:10.052
It is delicious, isn't it?

16:10.135 --> 16:13.389
With this, I have mastered
the skill of "cooking."

16:13.472 --> 16:16.350
- I allow you to thank and praise me.
- If Dotta or Venetim were here,

16:16.433 --> 16:18.644
they could have done a better job.

16:19.812 --> 16:23.732
I wonder if the budget for the rations
was properly divided.

16:23.816 --> 16:27.152
I need to hold
the Finance Minister accountable.

16:27.236 --> 16:28.362
Agreed.

16:28.445 --> 16:30.948
But we need to complete
this operation first.

16:31.991 --> 16:35.661
This operation is going smoothly,
isn't it, Xylo?

16:35.744 --> 16:39.707
- What?
- Are we close to the Demon Lord?

16:40.708 --> 16:41.709
Probably.

16:42.418 --> 16:45.879
You could say
it is all thanks to my grace.

16:46.463 --> 16:50.634
I am sure the Holy Knights
will be grateful to me too, right?

16:50.718 --> 16:53.303
Yes. Maybe just a little.

16:55.055 --> 16:56.473
My knight.

16:56.557 --> 17:01.061
How about we go and defeat the Demon Lord?

17:01.145 --> 17:02.354
Are you stupid?

17:02.438 --> 17:03.522
No way.

17:03.605 --> 17:05.357
Besides, that's insubordination.

17:05.858 --> 17:09.445
- But... but as a goddess...
- No.

17:10.195 --> 17:12.156
Then go stay with the Holy Knights.

17:12.239 --> 17:13.657
You are saying that again!

17:14.283 --> 17:15.909
My knight Xylo!

17:15.993 --> 17:18.620
You need to rely on me more.

17:18.704 --> 17:22.916
Until you say that
I am the supreme Goddess,

17:23.000 --> 17:25.085
I will not give up!

17:26.920 --> 17:27.796
Xylo.

17:27.880 --> 17:29.923
It's a transmission from the main force.

17:30.799 --> 17:34.094
Is this... an SOS?

17:34.178 --> 17:35.929
Calling... emergency backup...

17:36.013 --> 17:37.639
Requesting backup...

17:37.723 --> 17:40.934
We're being attacked by the Demon Blight...

17:45.272 --> 17:46.899
Commander, they're coming again!

17:48.108 --> 17:49.485
Prepare to intercept!

17:58.410 --> 17:59.953
Everyone, advance!

18:19.848 --> 18:21.683
They're getting beaten up
worse than I thought...

18:26.688 --> 18:27.940
- We have to help them...
- My knight.

18:31.193 --> 18:33.362
Those faeries...

18:33.445 --> 18:36.031
were originally humans, right?

18:37.116 --> 18:38.075
Yes.

18:38.158 --> 18:39.618
But they're knockers now.

18:45.207 --> 18:46.625
Keep attacking!

18:46.708 --> 18:49.253
I don't want to, but I have no choice.

18:49.878 --> 18:53.215
If the Holy Knights are wiped out,
we'll lose our heads too.

18:53.298 --> 18:56.552
Give the order,
Commander of the Holy Knights!

18:58.262 --> 18:59.888
Xylo Forbartz...

19:01.431 --> 19:03.976
- Flank them!
- Right!

19:04.560 --> 19:07.855
Go, my kingdom's elite soldiers!

19:07.938 --> 19:12.651
Grant peaceful rest to those citizens
who have transformed into faeries!

19:21.076 --> 19:23.829
- We should also...
- These people...

19:24.705 --> 19:27.749
can't go back to the way they were?

19:28.458 --> 19:29.668
What?

19:30.544 --> 19:32.504
In this town...

19:33.172 --> 19:36.175
there are still people
waiting for them to return...

19:38.010 --> 19:39.928
Once they become like that,

19:40.762 --> 19:42.514
there's no turning back...

19:46.518 --> 19:50.355
We should at least put them
out of their misery.

19:52.399 --> 19:54.401
Now! Charge!

20:13.295 --> 20:15.088
This is such a tough mission...

20:15.172 --> 20:16.131
Yes...

20:16.215 --> 20:18.675
I can't believe humans
could turn into faeries...

20:20.219 --> 20:21.136
What's this?

20:21.220 --> 20:22.971
No... Why...

20:23.055 --> 20:24.848
- Hey, are you okay?
- The sound...

20:24.932 --> 20:25.891
Hey!

20:27.142 --> 20:29.353
I... I don't want to hear it...

20:29.436 --> 20:30.270
That sound...

20:30.354 --> 20:31.563
Everyone...

20:32.147 --> 20:32.981
...by the sound...

20:34.316 --> 20:38.570
It seems more than ten miners
who couldn't escape were left here.

20:39.321 --> 20:40.697
That's terrible.

20:41.198 --> 20:45.202
They are loyal subjects
who serve my crown.

20:45.285 --> 20:47.412
We must save them no matter what.

20:47.496 --> 20:49.039
We can't.

20:49.122 --> 20:52.292
The purpose of this mission
is not to rescue civilians.

20:52.376 --> 20:55.337
If the Holy Knights were to suffer losses
because of this, it wouldn't be worth it.

20:57.130 --> 21:00.467
Xylo Forbartz,
I'd like to hear your opinion.

21:01.260 --> 21:04.012
If we switch to a rescue operation,

21:04.638 --> 21:07.474
how many casualties do you predict?

21:12.521 --> 21:15.065
So, you're hesitating too?

21:16.984 --> 21:18.986
Be prepared. There may be many casualties.

21:19.069 --> 21:21.905
If we have to fight in a narrow tunnel
while protecting civilians...

21:21.989 --> 21:23.240
Commander Kivia.

21:23.824 --> 21:25.200
With all due respect,

21:25.284 --> 21:28.453
do you really need to ask
that man's opinion?

21:29.204 --> 21:31.999
Set the scorched terrain seal
and block off the entire tunnel.

21:32.082 --> 21:34.668
Isn't that what Galtuile ordered?

21:36.420 --> 21:37.629
I know...

21:38.714 --> 21:42.592
Are you going to abandon
my people to their deaths...?

21:42.676 --> 21:49.016
You... all of you! Are you trying to
rebel... rebel against me?

21:49.891 --> 21:50.851
- You bastard!
- My.

21:50.934 --> 21:52.769
- What are you doing? Let go of me!
- How unsightly.

21:52.853 --> 21:55.230
Norgalle Senridge.

21:55.314 --> 21:58.275
The last disciple of Sage Hordeaux.

21:58.358 --> 22:01.361
I can't believe the man who was hailed
as a paragon by the Academy

22:01.445 --> 22:02.571
ended up like this.

22:02.654 --> 22:04.406
You traitors!

22:04.489 --> 22:07.242
I shall order each and every one
of you to be executed!

22:07.326 --> 22:08.827
Calm down, Your Majesty.

22:08.910 --> 22:09.786
If you raise your voice at them,

22:09.870 --> 22:11.371
the sacred seal
on your neck will kill you.

22:11.455 --> 22:13.623
Xylo, are you betraying me too?

22:26.344 --> 22:27.596
Damn it...

22:30.515 --> 22:33.852
- We'll handle the rescue ourselves.
- What?

22:33.935 --> 22:36.772
The frontline base has been set up.

22:36.855 --> 22:39.316
The Holy Knights can proceed as planned.

22:39.399 --> 22:42.694
If they can't escape in time,
bury them alive.

22:42.778 --> 22:45.489
For a hero,
failure means nothing but death.

22:46.698 --> 22:49.618
Xylo, that's my knight!

22:49.701 --> 22:52.204
You Holy Knights have
no objections, do you?

22:52.287 --> 22:55.624
Once we have rescued everyone,
you'd better sing our praises...

22:55.707 --> 22:57.667
Take care of Teoritta.

22:59.169 --> 23:01.671
- Huh?
- Of course.

23:01.755 --> 23:03.423
We can't let a goddess be buried alive.

23:05.217 --> 23:07.469
W-Wait, my knight!

23:07.552 --> 23:09.429
No matter when, I am always...

23:09.513 --> 23:10.847
Lady Teoritta.

23:10.931 --> 23:13.141
Xylo, you tricked me!

23:13.225 --> 23:15.185
You deserve to die for this!

23:16.269 --> 23:19.815
Everyone just says whatever they want...

23:20.398 --> 23:24.194
Honestly, I don't care
what happens to those commoners.

23:24.277 --> 23:25.278
But you know what?

23:25.362 --> 23:27.489
It pisses me off,

23:28.281 --> 23:30.659
whether it's the headquarters
that came up with this lousy operation

23:30.742 --> 23:33.829
or the people who are happy to see us die.

23:35.038 --> 23:37.707
The graves have been dug anyway.

23:39.126 --> 23:42.879
Let's see how far we can take this.
